Transformer LM resource accounting
Generated with Codex (GPT-5). Matrix multiply rule: 2*m*n*p FLOPs.

Formula map
  Symbols: L=num_layers, T=context_length, D=d_model, F=d_ff, V=vocab_size, H=num_heads
  Parameters
    token embeddings:            V * D
    per-layer attention:         4 * D * D  # W_Q, W_K, W_V, W_O
    per-layer SwiGLU FFN:        3 * D * F  # W1, W3, W2
    per-layer RMSNorms:          2 * D  # ln1, ln2
    transformer layers:          L * (4D^2 + 3DF + 2D)
    final RMSNorm:               D
    LM head:                     V * D
  Forward FLOPs
    QKV projections:             L * 3 * 2TDD
    attention scores QK^T:       L * 2TTD  # all heads combined
    attention weighted values:   L * 2TTD  # all heads combined
    attention output proj:       L * 2TDD
    SwiGLU W1/W3/W2:             L * 3 * 2TDF
    LM head logits:              2TDV

